{"id": "ws-3645425", "title": "模型推演各类资产计入的加息预期", "date": "2021-11-21", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3645425", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 4759, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "11e06ddaf81a11746ebd7e39bd5eb495f660c3800b81f34c30588b1c9847b37b", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金刘刚通过模型推演预期海外债券市场隐含加息未来一年2.1次；预期股票市场未来一年1.2次；预期黄金价格未来一年3.0次。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、李赫民等", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3648763", "title": "中金2022年十大预测：有惊无险", "date": "2022-01-04", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3648763", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6301, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "0ebbc9b17a2bf5420404c477de5c4e76beebab6aab0f765dfa4813f956dad042", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，2022年中外增长与政策周期再次反向，A股可能机会大于风险，看好中国产业升级与消费升级等结构性趋势。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "王汉锋、刘刚、李求索、刘均伟、李昭、黄凯松、魏冬", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3654701", "title": "刚启动的加息与快倒挂的曲线", "date": "2022-03-20", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3654701", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6546, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "f4d41de1d2986962673244e1f4c9768b1c7babac452161902c118847f7e344b6", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "当前期限利差过窄，2s10s只有不到25bp，一旦倒挂，则可能引发市场的衰退担忧。不过，过度依赖2s10s作为判断美国很快走向“衰退”的信号可能会有偏差，主要是由于当前2s10s或部分失真。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、李赫民、王汉锋", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3655858", "title": "美债收益率曲线倒挂八问八答", "date": "2022-04-01", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3655858", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 7527, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "b4f02fa97d46bfe8f20dea3728c197a39ba1ac787c67f4c6305f7ef318a03e84", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "倒挂后资产如何反应？市场继续上行，但估值收缩；曲线倒挂后期为股债大宗；初期金融周期、后期科技领先。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金公司刘刚、李赫民、李雨婕、王汉锋", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3659768", "title": "港币触发弱方保证的含义与影响", "date": "2022-05-19", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3659768", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 3206, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "cedf752a23c84ff8303c1fef8dade7e07cbe290427934421155da13e837275ea", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，香港金管局入市为联系汇率机制下的正常操作。港币走弱和香港加息对股市影响相对有限，但本地地产板块或边际承压，银行相对受益。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、陈南丁、王汉锋，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3663567", "title": "衰退风险与美股熊市的历史关系", "date": "2022-07-01", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3663567", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6560, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "6bbd74fc4bbf2149e75c620b858292a32d472b5230aef0208c9833f789f5d937", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金预计，美国金融条件收紧对增长压力可能在今年底和明年初出现，并且大概率不会深度衰退。在轻度衰退的冲击下，美股平均跌幅~20%，估值在一倍标准差下方有支撑。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、李赫民、李雨婕，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3666449", "title": "中概股转成主要上市意味着什么？", "date": "2022-08-02", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3666449", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 2840, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "ef2372b26935f9f30bc7eb9e55af551e92d9e899b683cb13c0dd22c32a142eca", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金指出，转成主要上市可以摆脱外部上市地位变化的影响，港股本身交易和可兑换性都不受影响，可以纳入沪港通、进而增加流动性。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚 寇玥，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3670072", "title": "全球美元流动性或进一步收紧", "date": "2022-09-12", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3670072", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 4966, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "1422d13d42c155916fb5294216443454ccfd71760c7cd711d079bb23e56f195c", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "供给约束高通胀下的被迫紧缩将加大欧洲增长压力，继续推高美元，助推全球美元流动性减少。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、李赫民等", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3671480", "title": "当前主要资产计入了多少加息预期？", "date": "2022-09-29", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3671480", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6084, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "f3e1bdbf144eb65163aafcd4cc4dcaaf9d76f395850346554d9eae75b6c7363e", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金指出，目前美股计入基本充分， 短端国债不足，长债透支了较多预期，黄金计入不足。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、李赫民，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3677233", "title": "近期美国股债背离传递了何种信号？", "date": "2022-12-12", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3677233", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 4912, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "2783d997fa59d18076df59f3c63dd9ebb638d322886a0a30cf101cd9f9b14772", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，近期美股和美债的明显背离反映了分母端利率抢跑和分子端衰退压力加大。衰退是大概率，程度取决于与通胀的赛跑。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、李赫民、杨萱庭", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3678860", "title": "中金2023年十大预测", "date": "2023-01-03", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3678860", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6227, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "770eb52eb5abe22821ccb7f5522b4cb9044a92f14cbf83dd3ece4df351ed51eb", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中国有望在2023年实现全球率先复苏；A股和港股2023年有望实现明显正收益，港股阶段性跑赢A股；疫后伴随需求修复，国内通胀或面临阶段性压力；中国货币宽松势减，利率中枢上行，大类资产股强于债......", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、李求索等", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3682354", "title": "美国经济是否还面临衰退压力？", "date": "2023-02-20", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3682354", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 8070, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "72311e2d3a4d76fb8b4a4b4987cb8d556b5527dc1f7457e49192311e0851a68f", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金指出，美国经济彻底摆脱下行趋势还为时尚早，预期转鹰或加息延后会通过推高金融条件和融资成本再度抑制需求，结构性错位可能也会使增长趋弱的大方向难以短期逆转。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、李赫民、杨萱庭，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3683453", "title": "互联互通新阶段：纳入外国公司的意义", "date": "2023-03-07", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3683453", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 4373, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "fde1e172d6e6c2184c66b259ec827b6d76dd7060814219c40bce49891a531898", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "外国公司首次成为内地投资者直接投资标的，对资本市场开放和香港都有重要意义。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚 （执业证书编号：S0080512030003）等", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3691822", "title": "美股科技龙头的抱团与拥挤程度", "date": "2023-06-26", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3691822", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 7049, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "c0f00907365816e993b541c3f8414d3619d3b131a0d21b5bb7838f62d15b085d", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，美股资金抱团明显，短期情绪偏高，而长期回报主要来源于盈利而非估值，考虑到美国下半年增长压力会逐步增加，当前盈利还未下调充分的价值与周期部分仍有盈利下修压力。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、李赫民", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3692373", "title": "中美均面临关键窗口期", "date": "2023-07-04", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3692373", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6621, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "57c0dd5153530b18f7c420dae7c0bcc70464f23a98867c2dfb2afb259bc4efb9", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，当前美国面临7月后加息路径的确认，中国面临增长政策预期的兑现，这些都是较为重要的窗口期，将决定后续资产走向。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金公司刘刚（S0080512030003 SFC CE Ref：AVH867）、李赫民（S0080522070008 SFC CE Ref：BQG067）、杨萱庭（S0080122080405）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3693868", "title": "市场与美联储的分歧有多大", "date": "2023-07-23", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3693868", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 4136, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8dd014ee1d0674731e3e45020f1ea625b168414411647cc867fae1be893d12ef", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司表示，市场已充分计入7月加息，9月加息概率下降但需验证通胀目标，年内和明年初降息概率不大。关于各类资产已计入多少预期，按照程度排序为美股、利率期货、黄金、长端美债。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金公司刘刚、杨萱庭、李赫民", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3694105", "title": "审视美国再工业化和引导产业链重构", "date": "2023-07-27", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3694105", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 14333, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "d60ee2031eed525f7cc518cc62b7b94228ac80ec08beb09184171ba546d7fa6e", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，美国引导的产业链重构可能会吸引外资向其他具有一定廉价劳动力资源和工业基础的国家如东南亚转移。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚（S0080512030003），李雨婕（S0080523030005）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3695429", "title": "美国经济为何迟迟没衰退？", "date": "2023-08-14", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3695429", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5417, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "7ee129ac146fe27a4a67f987ce6d89f7340f5c9199fecec2e251ddb377d8e65f", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，本轮美国经济存在“时间上”的明显错位，之后的方向仍是放缓，程度上不到衰退，但明年压力增加。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、杨萱庭、李赫民", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3695968", "title": "美股是否危险了？", "date": "2023-08-21", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3695968", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6277, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8462299341f2384d01a5a21af1d470dbdfad07f8cadaad22a97b4fe857456aab", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金指出，金融流动性转弱和获利了结下，预计美股三季度震荡趋弱，四季度增长压力增加甚至带来更大压力，直到逼宽松预期后反弹。但也不预期深度调整，技术面已经接近超卖，纳指当前处于主要支撑位上。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、李赫民、李雨婕，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3699282", "title": "本轮美债利率上行的几点不同特征", "date": "2023-10-10", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3699282", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6447, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8ebeb279da6714a67cedc2398392b7ea593fb95348aa5f31fbd95afa033ee718", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金指出，美债利率和美元同涨，并不常见，意味着美国国内和海外美元流动性都在收紧，对新兴更不利。快速上行的利率和美元本身也会触发风险。当前美债技术面超卖，但交易上自我实现，短期难言见顶，需要较差的数据或风险事件逆转，又或冲到高位后增加再配置吸引力。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚S0080512030003、李雨婕S0080523030005、杨萱庭S0080122080405", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3699887", "title": "中美库存周期的错位与共振", "date": "2023-10-18", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3699887", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 17524, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "e2379350fb4a6c1eee8de59dff83f9a705b59c9eb081d5dd3240a990d511c8c6", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金预计，本轮库存和增长修复路径有可能更多是“U”型而非“V”型，这也就意味着全局性的补库存和价格上涨可能性不大，可以更多聚焦结构性较低库存带来的价格弹性。股市层面，仍以结构性机会为主也意味着哑铃型配置依然适用。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚S0080512030003、李赫民S0080522070008", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3700517", "title": "中央加杠杆是对症下药", "date": "2023-10-26", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3700517", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 3580, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8fda7c84397806964d9f0a71f738e371800bfdd978246bff140cb2a7e4a5006e", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "当前抓手在信用，信用的抓手又在中央政府杠杆。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚 、张巍瀚", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": true, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3705407", "title": "2023年，美股靠什么新高？", "date": "2024-01-02", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3705407", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5441, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "6f7b03f393730407c9aec7c6bfe2915cf7bd144d171e9d4effe4fcce4bb390c6", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，美股2023年全年表现上成长风格跑赢、科技龙头主导。盈利贡献为主，风险溢价压降对冲利率变化。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚 （执证编号：S0080512030003）、李赫民（执证编号：S0080522070008）、杨萱庭（执证编号：S0080122080405）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": true, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3706540", "title": "日股还能买么？", "date": "2024-01-17", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3706540", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 3817, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "a327c2cf59ffe9b3daab7c5c255f0a44f473b77a684ff161b217bb77d315bb54", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，当前日经225指数19.5x估值已超过2011年以来日股估值平稳后的18.7x平均水平。从情绪指标看，日经225指数已经进入超买区间。中金建议，维持日股标配，短期不建议过度追高；中期结构性变化预期尤在，日本在全球依然被低配。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚（执业证书编号：S0080512030003）、李雨婕（执业证书编号：S0080523030005）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3708605", "title": "外资流到哪了？", "date": "2024-02-20", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3708605", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5236, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "b79503fe81ff9691ae1b0d9980e9fc4ff7fa11b348dac3291efdabd9710ef6ff", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，主动外资维持弱势，近期欧洲资金为流出主力。目前各主要区域资金均已低配中国，日、印等国配置比例有不同程度增加。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚（SAC 执证编号：S0080512030003）、张巍瀚（SAC 执证编号：S0080524010002）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": true, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3713860", "title": "上次黄金、利率与美元同涨发生了什么？", "date": "2024-04-29", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3713860", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6564, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8975c2dbdb3c05b329716438711bc9122f7b5e79dee7826e0b95c97c1ec79486", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "传统定价框架下，黄金通常与美元、美债利率反向变动。但近期这一定价规律“失灵”了，黄金、利率和美元同涨。根据历史经验，如果本月三者上涨同时发生，下一个月和两个月金价转为下跌的频率分别为59.6%和57.9%。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚 、李雨婕等", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3714405", "title": "如何把握不断轮动的资产风口", "date": "2024-05-08", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3714405", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5451, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "2107c54d1f051bc86670818d268be974a2201e62e700c60710d8b25dae5d6209", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "从比特币到日股，到黄金与铜再到当前的港股，每次超预期大涨后都透支回调。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚（执证编号：S0080512030003）、杨萱庭（SAC 执证编号：S0080122080405）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3715237", "title": "港股还有多少上涨空间？", "date": "2024-05-19", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3715237", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6514, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8308e9ba22d15b0bc7314f0f8836feba41ea0fa5d77ed20f85490ae85b30039e", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "假设风险溢价回到2023年初水平，恒指第一阶段假设目标点位为19,000-20,000点，目前已基本接近。市场进一步上涨的动力来自：1）无风险利率进一步回落；2）更为重要的是盈利增长，中金测算如果2024年盈利增长10%，或将有望推动市场攀升至22,000点，而盈利增长高度依赖后续财政发力力度与进展。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、王牧遥等", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3718003", "title": "美国大选如何影响政策与资产", "date": "2024-06-25", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3718003", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 7396, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "32def77776035c31e49c4d71f598a4b00555b3e2b0b2347cc663f205ec42d42f", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "大选后政策刺激预期和增长修复、通胀回升都将给美债利率带来更多上行压力；美股整体表现不差，但共和党当选结构上可能提振部分周期股情绪；短期美元没有大幅走弱基础；特朗普的政策主张下油价表现可能相对中性。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚 杨萱庭 李雨婕", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3729947", "title": "中美周期拐点的交易策略", "date": "2024-10-10", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3729947", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6442, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "faa004cd0ab04ba3eab748fb8b6b85e62dd2b90a2c8424c5384ffc3ca783b233", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金表示，当前的中国政策发力及美国衰退预期降温，表明方向已经出变化，国内面临的外部宽松环境最大的时候可能逐步过去，反过来会约束我们内部的宽松空间，也进一步凸显了财政力度的重要性。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚（SAC执证编号：S0080512030003）、李雨婕（SAC执证编号：S0080523030005）、杨萱庭（SAC执证编号：S0080524070028）", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3735805", "title": "特朗普交易的节奏与节点", "date": "2024-12-02", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3735805", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5615, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "1feb9ac88fcb57159ddbade19b1db7324fe9da35d4c28ef2c216a41121710f60", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，1月20日正式就任，特朗普将会签署一系列移民行政令，进行加征关税、结束电动车强制令等工作；1-2月，特朗普将发表国会演讲，重申或提出执政理念；2-3月，特朗普将提交新财年预算案，给出更清晰的财政支出和削减方向，推进税改政策。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚S0080512030003、李雨婕S0080523030005，文章", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3738515", "title": "2025年开年的关键变数", "date": "2025-01-07", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3738515", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 7233, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "3cd8b195ff4b50c035b63743574344993521ff3d552069ab77da57da2a6083d3", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金表示，2025年资产走向的关键变数在于特朗普政策的顺序和强度、AI产业趋势，中美双方的汇率干预程度。2025年开年，恰逢一些关键变化，例如1月初美国债务上限、1月底特朗普就任后的政策进展，1月底美联储议息，以及1月中美股四季度业绩期。在目前资产预期计入充分的情况下，上述变化也会直接决定资产的后续方向。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚S0080512030003、王子琳S0080123090053，文章", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3741184", "title": "谁是本轮港股上涨买入的主力？", "date": "2025-02-15", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3741184", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 1602, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "9848250d991548fd47ef43e03709ff16c6892dda1c76edcdc8f275b0c65a7fb2", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "南向资金流入增加，但分歧也在加大，体现在南向周二周四净流出，同时南向资金虽然流入阿里，但流出前期强势的小米和腾讯；作为海外资金主力的长线外资依然流出，表明长线外资在本轮反弹中不是主力；被动ETF资金流入明显加速，这部分可能以个人投资者为主；交易型资金应该也有流入，甚至可能是阶段性的主力。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、张巍瀚", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": true, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3741676", "title": "谁在买港股？", "date": "2025-02-23", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3741676", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 3953, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "5ee7e4d33ae45da0d268bafc840dd2c173f97d076c935ea4fbaac530b9b11836", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "关于外资有多少配置空间，中金测算：1）情形一，如果后续主动外资对投向全球和亚洲除日本市场的配置降至近五年低点，对应流入63亿美元；2）情形二：目前1.1个百分点的低配全部转为标配（2021年底时情形），对应403亿美元的流入，相当于EPFR口径下2021年以来流出中国市场的总规模（约419亿美元）。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚，本文", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3742767", "title": "中美的两本账", "date": "2025-03-11", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3742767", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 7443, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "d408cd67c16c2afcc65dc2558a82d97712d07810841d2da964d8b7a7ceea9e59", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "美国经常账户长期赤字，但AI产业吸引资金流入金融账户，支撑美元和经济。中国经常账户顺差，但金融账户资金流出，外需强而资金外流。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、项心力、杨萱庭", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3743381", "title": "美股泡沫破裂了吗？——与互联网泡沫的对比", "date": "2025-03-19", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3743381", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 16768, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "112fe4b84865e0a9c1d5dd357644f69261b8ac59e4507182c8a33f78d135713c", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金认为，从市场微观结构看，本轮AI行情更多类似于1997~1998年泡沫形成的初期，这并不意味着就一定会演变成泡沫，因为虽然科技龙头股集中度更高，但与净利润的匹配程度也更高，情绪亢奋程度也远没有达到2000年泡沫高点。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "中金刘刚、杨萱庭", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3744329", "title": "美国例外论与东升西落的内核", "date": "2025-04-01", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3744329", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 9075, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "4fc669451e1507bc5db43dc6bfc44256d94e9547da2e573858dc2a2472cfec9b", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，美国\"例外论\"的三大支柱(大财政、AI趋势、资金再平衡)正面临来自欧洲防务自主扩张、中国DeepSeek异军突起，叠加特朗普关税政策风险的挑战，但是决定“东升西落”趋势能否持续的关键在于美国关税政策、中美财政发力力度以及科技股盈利兑现情况，尤其是4月2日美国对等关税实施细节将成为近期市场走向的关键转折点。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、项心力", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3746046", "title": "公募买了多少港股？", "date": "2025-04-28", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3746046", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5675, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "f757872b0fa2a6661b97fcb3c03fb66bb18187635fddeb18e3b737d22d2804c2", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司指出，截至2025年一季度，可投资港股公募基金持股市值6,509亿人民币，港股持仓占其股票投资市值比例已经升至36.9%，创近五年以来最高水平。主动偏股型基金港股持仓占比升至30.8%的历史新高，行业配置上公募基金偏好新经济，持仓占比升至近80%，电商互联网、半导体等板块增持最多。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚，张瀚巍", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3748306", "title": "A to H上市浪潮影响有多大？", "date": "2025-06-03", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3748306", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 8144, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "586150a17e922daa82280da89ed6b8121d1d3a207d608283f6248caa234f09fa", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "为什么A to H上市模式越来越多？为什么港股反而能比A股贵？这对港股有什么短期和中长期意义？", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚，张巍瀚", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": true, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3748811", "title": "共识化的去美元", "date": "2025-06-10", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3748811", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 23849, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "79659a87d6f0746ce6a9841f4fcbf54e25e5804ea57dd5d80ca358f37e5e2b04", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，上半年“去美元化”共识可能面临两大问题：去美元幅度不及预期，美国资产或再跑赢。下半年美国信用周期有可能重启，主要依靠私人部门扩张，财政则小幅收缩，如果三四季度再叠加一些正面催化，如减税和降息，则有可能推动美国资产跑赢。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、缪延亮、杨萱庭、项心力", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3749493", "title": "Hibor如何影响港股？", "date": "2025-06-20", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3749493", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 5330, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "340e2d265b5638a4a1382b8ac3e80b04179cc348a91ccf284dd45c181ba21dd5", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金公司认为，Hibor骤降提振港股表现，特别是新消费、创新药等抱团成长股，但也导致港币快速贬值至弱方保证附近。随着港币接近7.85弱方保证，金管局或将回收流动性，Hibor难以更低甚至可能收紧，叠加南向资金透支、IPO供给压力等因素，港股流动性难以更强甚至可能边际收紧，近期回调也表明了这一点。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、王牧遥", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3753512", "title": "美联储降息对中国市场真的是利好吗？", "date": "2025-08-18", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3753512", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 4756, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "2d9ad34c0a2f3170a15e9cf799c18feeea9d40b2fce22be0fbb5d8ff233c11ae", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金刘刚认为，市场普遍认为美联储降息对中国市场构成利好的观点存在误区。关键问题在于降息类型：预防式降息（如2024年9月、2019年7月）往往导致美债利率和美元在降息后见底回升，而非持续走弱。当前美国经济压力有限，降息后基本面将快速好转。因此，降息对中国市场仅构成短期利好，且很快会逆转。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": false, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-solo", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3757033", "title": "中美关税再升级的背后", "date": "2025-10-12", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3757033", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 2325, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "8dfa74012248a4d22840b87088a0721e0a117af43f44dfe928c97843c5127f25", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "中金刘刚称，本轮关税摩擦历经了升级、缓和、到近期再“升级”的三个阶段。10月以来，中美双方在船舶费用、稀土出口管制、反垄断等多个方面出现摩擦增多迹象。“稀土出口管制”这一政策的“杀伤力”更大，也是特朗普全面提高关税的主要借口。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚Kevin", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": false, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-solo", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
{"id": "ws-3758517", "title": "谁是港股资金的主力和增量？", "date": "2025-11-03", "account": "Kevin策略研究 / 中金海外策略", "source_url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3758517", "source_type": "high-quality-repost", "fulltext_status": "full", "character_count": 6743, "length_class": "longform", "content_hash": "266d9e44d18ef5acba6bce6a78ff55ad53b370014bee77e74e33bd88f60fc03f", "body_stored": false, "evidence_excerpt": "港股年内领跑全球，日均成交额同比近翻倍，南向资金累计流入创1.26万亿港元历史新高。市场活跃度提升主要受益于全球分散化配置需求与国内\"存款活化\"共同驱动，但外资回流呈现分化——亚太资金接近标配而欧美资金低配加深，尚未形成共识；同时南向后续增量空间可能受限。", "source_quality": 0.85, "verification_method": "curated-direct-public-url", "attribution": {"visible_author_line": "刘刚、张巍", "liugang_present": true, "coauthored": true, "zhang_weihan_present": false, "li_hemin_present": false, "classification": "liugang-explicit-coauthored", "source_form": "public-repost"}}
